aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hydrogen line only mode: frequency switching, no calibration needed. The
    tab shows which calibration is in use, with an info button.
  * Hydrogen line in dB above baseline, shown beside the raw plot.
  * Median filter n and m in Settings.
  * Hydrogen line only mode keeps retrying a failed capture.
  * Windows: the capture tool ends with the app, so a crash cannot leave the
    radio locked until a reboot.
  * Settings: switch to let other computers on the network see this node.
  * Node API keeps retrying when its address is not up yet at boot.

